<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sunstone rated strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sunstone rated strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of Sunstone Hotel Investors Inc with a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock was added to the firm's focus list and named CS First Boston's featured stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/4 at 13-5/8.</p>
</text>
